% references.bib — the single source of truth (SSOT) for every cited work in the MAGE book.
%
% One entry per work. A `[cite: <key>]` marker in a chapter resolves against a key here (an unknown
% key fails the build loud — the CITE-RESOLVE gate). Chicago strings are rendered ONCE from this file
% by book/render_citations.py (Typst/Hayagriva engine) into book/data/citations.json, which BOTH the
% HTML web build and the Typst PDF consume — so the two surfaces cannot drift. Do NOT author reference
% strings anywhere else; edit the data here and re-run render_citations.py.
%
% After editing this file: `python3 book/render_citations.py` (regenerates + re-stamps citations.json;
% the CITE-FRESH gate fails the build until you do).

